      "username": "RySmith6",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rysmith6/{size}/1852_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-06-09T20:30:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>…is something I wish existed, if for no other reason than our team for the Tactics tournament could have a place to stay the night after the tournament.&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=9\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"> <br><span>We are driving up from Virginia Beach overnight friday to reach the tourney on saturday, and would be more than grateful for a couch(or floor space!) after the tournament, before leaving on sunday morning.</span><br><br>Forgoing fancy folk finding favor in fine fellows and feasting us in their Freedom Tower, does anyone have a suggestion for where the three of us might stay for a night? A(preferably cheap) hotel/inn/cave/plague locus/bunker in the area that any wandering sentinels might have stayed at before?<br><br>Any information can be repaid in fresh, homemade cookies! Or as fresh as a 15-hour drive can keep cookies…&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:49.522Z",
